                             <a class=\"btn btn-link collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#collapseImportantInfo\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"collapseImportantInfo\">\n                                        Important event information\n                                    </a>\n                                </h5>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div id=\"collapseImportantInfo\" class=\"collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"important-info\" data-parent=\"#accordionImportantInfo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                <div class=\"card-body\">\n                                    <p><b>Location</b><br>\nChristmas at Backyard Cinema takes place indoors at 49 Tanner Street, London Bridge.</p>\n\n<p><b>Arrival &amp; Last Entry</b><br>\nDoors open <b>15 minutes before the advertised start time.</b> Last entry is <b>15 minutes after the start time.</b> Please arrive early to avoid missing the show.</p>\n\n<p><b>Facilities</b><br>\n• No cloakroom or storage for large bags<br>\n• Buggies/pushchairs are not permitted inside<br>\n• Hot food cannot be brought into the venue<br>\n• Excellent transport links are nearby</p>\n\n<p><b>Accessibility</b><br>\n• Accessible seating is available at every performance<br>\n• The event space is step-free, but please note there are <b>bark surfaces and uneven ground</b> in some areas<br>\n• For specific access needs, please contact us in advance</p>\n\n<p><b>Special Effects &amp; Atmosphere</b><br>\nThe show features <b>live music, haze, flashing lights, snow effects, and dark spaces.</b> For more detail, email us at hello@backyardcinema.co.uk</p>\n\n<p><b>Children &amp; Tickets</b><br>\n• The event is <b>recommended for ages 6+</b><br>\n• <b>Child tickets</b> are available for under-12s at <b>matinee performances only</b><br>\n• Evening shows are charged at <b>adult ticket prices</b> for all ages<br>\n• Please <b>check the film rating</b> before booking e.g. Love Actually is rated <b>15</b></p>\n\n<p><b>Content &amp; Atmosphere</b><br>\nThe show is <b>family friendly;</b> there is no nudity in any cabaret. Expect <b>singing, dancing, festive drinks available for adults, and plenty of Christmas cheer.</b></p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            \n            \n            \n\n            <div class=\"margin-t20\">\n\t\t\t    <div id=\"accordionFairAccess\">\n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"card-header\" id=\"headingFairAccess\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <h5 class=\"mb-0 blockBottomBorder\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <a class=\"btn btn-link collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#collapseFA\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"collapseFA\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    Fair access to tickets information\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    </h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t    <div id=\"collapseFA\" class=\"collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFairAccess\" data-parent=\"#accordionFairAccess\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"card-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <p>Ticketek takes the issue of ticket touting seriously.</p> <p>Please comply with any stated ticket limit for this event. If you exceed the ticket limit, Ticketek may at its discretion cancel any or all of your ticket orders and tickets without notice.</p> <p>This includes ticket orders associated by the same name, email address, billing address/delivery address, credit card number or any other details provided to Ticketek.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"show-card small\" id=\"accordions-second\">\n        <div class=\"showContent\">\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-info-block\">\n\t\t\t\t<di